      "updated": 1793787600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4A. Deterministic CI/CD Quality Ship Gate\n- Compares v1_baseline -> v2_optimized lift\n- Blocks PR/deploy if Response Quality, Tool Use,\n  or Safety falls below threshold\n- Outputs scorecard.json + scorecard.md",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "cicd_gate",
      "originalText": "4A. Deterministic CI/CD Quality Ship Gate\n- Compares v1_baseline -> v2_optimized lift\n- Blocks PR/deploy if Response Quality, Tool Use,\n  or Safety falls below threshold\n- Outputs scorecard.json + scorecard.md",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
