      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4B. Continuous OnlineEvaluator & Drift Alert\n- OnlineEvaluator samples Cloud Trace every 10m\n- Scores live OTel v1.39.0 traces asynchronously\n- Cloud Monitoring Alert Policy:\n  aiplatform.googleapis.com/OnlineEvaluator\n  online_evaluator/scores (ALIGN_PERCENTILE_50 < 0.80)",
